# 3. MANDATORY PHASE — GLOBAL FRONTIER TECHNOLOGY RESEARCH

Do not stop after auditing the repository.

Research what is happening outside the project.

The goal is not merely to copy current industry patterns, but to discover opportunities that the project's existing architecture and roadmap may have overlooked.

