- Dynamic knowledge-to-game experiences.
- Human-agent community ecosystems.
- Spatial knowledge navigation.
- Adaptive interactive storytelling.
- Intelligent software maintenance systems.
- Agent-native platform orchestration.
- New forms of creator and community participation.

